WEBVTT

00:13.250 --> 00:14.340
<b>Now what?</b>

00:15.400 --> 00:18.200
<b>Here, in this loaded pause,</b>

00:18.460 --> 00:19.700
<b>what would NO NAME...</b>

00:19.940 --> 00:22.290
<b>what would Hinami do?</b>

00:24.710 --> 00:25.900
<b><i>Game set!</i></b>

00:26.550 --> 00:27.790
<b>Wait, what?</b>

00:27.170 --> 00:29.140
<b><i>Winner: Found!</i></b>

00:30.710 --> 00:34.470
<b><i>This might be what Hinami was thinking:</i></b>

00:35.250 --> 00:38.470
<b><i>If I'm going to get caught up 
in some high-risk mind games,</i></b>

00:38.470 --> 00:41.850
<b><i>I'm better off just taking a sure hit.</i></b>

00:42.360 --> 00:44.720
<b>Way too single-minded, if you ask me.</b>

00:47.350 --> 00:49.360
<b>NO NAME: I win</b>

00:49.880 --> 00:52.780
<b>Jeez. Competitive much?</b>

00:52.780 --> 00:55.780
<b>NO NAME: I win 
nanashi: Big deal, 1 out of 14</b>

00:54.250 --> 00:55.780
<b><i>And after that...</i></b>

00:56.360 --> 00:57.410
<b><i>Game set!</i></b>

00:57.910 --> 00:58.910
<b><i>Game set!</i></b>

00:59.410 --> 01:00.610
<b><i>Game set!</i></b>

01:00.950 --> 01:02.940
<b><i>Winner: Found!</i></b>

01:02.940 --> 01:04.950
<b><i>In the end,</i></b>

01:05.460 --> 01:08.420
<b><i>I beat her handily, 17 matches to one.</i></b>

01:05.460 --> 01:10.460
<b>NO NAME: I win 
 nanashi: Big deal, 1 out of 14 
 nanashi: Sorry, 1 out of 17</b>

01:09.230 --> 01:10.460
<b>Sorry.</b>

01:10.460 --> 01:12.840
<b>Turns out I'm pretty competitive, too.</b>

02:44.010 --> 02:47.020
<b>2nd Stage: Lv. 6
Everyone has different expectations 
about a big event</b>

02:44.010 --> 02:47.020
<b>Sewing Room 2</b>

02:47.480 --> 02:48.430
<b>Now, then:</b>

02:48.660 --> 02:51.690
<b>Let's go through some facts first, shall we?</b>

02:51.960 --> 02:56.240
<b>You had something to ask me 
about the Hanabi situation?</b>

02:57.030 --> 02:57.870
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:02.910 --> 03:05.870
<b>What you did to Konno... 
that was all calculated.</b>

03:06.380 --> 03:08.040
<b>Do I have that right?</b>

03:08.300 --> 03:09.040
<b>Yes.</b>

03:10.660 --> 03:15.040
<b>I made Erika think that Nakamura 
and Yuzu were in cahoots.</b>

03:15.040 --> 03:19.420
<b>Once she's off-balance, it only 
takes a little push to tip her over.</b>

03:20.000 --> 03:23.920
<b>While exploiting her weaknesses, 
I made an example out of her,</b>

03:23.920 --> 03:26.820
<b>then shut it all down with 
no one else in the wrong.</b>

03:27.590 --> 03:28.810
<b>That's all.</b>

03:29.040 --> 03:33.310
<b>Still, you didn't have 
to be so cruel about it.</b>

03:33.810 --> 03:35.280
<b>Cruel, huh?</b>

03:36.070 --> 03:41.510
<b>You used someone's crush to tear 
her pride to shreds in public.</b>

03:42.320 --> 03:45.570
<b>For me, that... that was a step too far.</b>

03:45.840 --> 03:50.160
<b>If I hadn't, I wouldn't have been 
able to stop Konno so quickly.</b>

03:50.160 --> 03:52.080
<b>She was all fired up...</b>

03:52.400 --> 03:55.330
<b>I had to crush her spirit completely.</b>

03:55.560 --> 03:59.340
<b>But was that final blow really necessary?</b>

03:59.830 --> 04:02.590
<b>You didn't need to use Nakamura like that.</b>

04:02.590 --> 04:05.590
<b>Brandishing the tissue 
cover Izumi made for him...</b>

04:06.240 --> 04:08.100
<b>That's just kicking her when she's down.</b>

04:08.400 --> 04:10.340
<b>I suppose you're right.</b>

04:10.340 --> 04:12.750
<b>Then why do something so cruel?</b>

04:13.500 --> 04:14.830
<b>Cruel?</b>

04:14.830 --> 04:19.480
<b>When you consider what she'd done 
to Hanabi, I don't find it cruel at all.</b>

04:19.740 --> 04:23.740
<b>In other words... it was revenge?</b>

04:23.980 --> 04:25.240
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

04:27.250 --> 04:28.870
<b>I see...</b>

04:29.080 --> 04:30.120
<b>What?</b>

04:30.380 --> 04:33.620
<b>So I get angry. Is that so surprising?</b>

04:33.990 --> 04:34.660
<b>No...</b>

04:35.630 --> 04:39.610
<b>I like righteous Hanabi, 
who stays true to herself.</b>

04:40.390 --> 04:43.820
<b>When Erika Konno started 
harassing Hirabayashi,</b>

04:44.240 --> 04:48.310
<b>Hanabi called her out—in her 
own words—in front of everyone.</b>

04:48.310 --> 04:52.140
<b>It was uncalculated. She was undaunted.</b>

04:52.140 --> 04:54.380
<b>I thought her strength was beautiful.</b>

04:55.590 --> 05:00.060
<b>So when Konno was trampling that for 
no reason, I couldn't let it go.</b>

05:01.000 --> 05:05.200
<b>That's why I worked to destroy 
everything about that situation.</b>

05:05.690 --> 05:08.090
<b>And why I didn't feel like 
letting it just hang there.</b>

05:08.630 --> 05:11.450
<b>That's all. What's wrong with that?</b>

05:11.730 --> 05:12.360
<b>I mean...</b>

05:13.220 --> 05:14.830
<b>Nothing, but—</b>

05:15.170 --> 05:17.830
<b>Right? Then what's the problem?</b>

05:18.340 --> 05:20.590
<b>Here's how I see it:</b>

05:20.890 --> 05:25.650
<b>Hurting someone for no real reason,
 no real gain, is just...</b>

05:26.890 --> 05:29.850
<b>When it comes to how NO NAME plays the game?</b>

05:30.560 --> 05:31.850
<b>It's not right.</b>

05:33.390 --> 05:37.140
<b>Maybe so, now that you mention it.</b>

05:37.720 --> 05:38.960
<b>Still,</b>

05:39.610 --> 05:42.720
<b>there are some things even I can't forgive.</b>

05:47.110 --> 05:48.820
<b>Good morning, Tomozaki.</b>

05:50.070 --> 05:52.130
<b>Hey, Izumi. Mornin'.</b>

05:52.130 --> 05:53.740
<b>Sure has gotten cold, huh?</b>

05:54.040 --> 05:56.460
<b>That's November for you.</b>

05:56.960 --> 05:58.500
<b>Oh, that reminds me...</b>

05:58.790 --> 06:01.750
<b>What's been going on with 
Konno and Kamimae lately?</b>

06:02.020 --> 06:07.470
<b>Mmm, you know... girl stuff... I guess?</b>

06:07.710 --> 06:10.160
<b>Outwardly, it <i>looks</i> like 
they're getting along,</b>

06:10.160 --> 06:13.970
<b>but Erika and Mao both badmouth 
each other behind their backs...</b>

06:14.200 --> 06:18.860
<b>And in bringing them together, 
you're caught in the middle.</b>

06:20.240 --> 06:21.930
<b>Exactly!</b>

06:22.410 --> 06:25.830
<b>But I figure it's something only I can fix.</b>

06:25.830 --> 06:26.990
<b>I'll hang in there!</b>

06:27.320 --> 06:29.110
<b>Must be rough.</b>

06:29.410 --> 06:34.120
<b>It's better than the two of 
them being all awkward.</b>

06:34.620 --> 06:37.870
<b>I owe Tama some big-time thanks.</b>

06:38.160 --> 06:41.830
<b>So tiny and cute again today, Tama!</b>

06:38.810 --> 06:41.830
<b>Not a lot of people could pull that off.</b>

06:41.830 --> 06:44.240
<b>Back off already, Minmi!</b>

06:41.830 --> 06:45.970
<b>I could learn something from her myself.</b>

06:47.390 --> 06:50.260
<b>You've got to change what you 
don't like about yourself.</b>

06:50.260 --> 06:54.010
<b>I think you've changed 
quite a bit lately, Izumi.</b>

06:54.400 --> 06:58.390
<b>Yeah. I've been thinking that, too.</b>

06:59.350 --> 07:00.220
<b>Yeah?</b>

07:04.360 --> 07:08.860
<b>Culture Festival</b>

07:09.100 --> 07:12.110
<b>Okay, the culture festival is coming up.</b>

07:12.370 --> 07:15.220
<b>The big day is December 22.</b>

07:15.220 --> 07:19.000
<b>Go on and get fired up. It's your
 last chance to have fun.</b>

07:19.630 --> 07:22.120
<b>You'll be in full-on study mode soon enough.</b>

07:22.640 --> 07:27.770
<b>We'll pick four committee 
members in our next homeroom,</b>

07:27.770 --> 07:30.040
<b>so think it over if you're interested.</b>

07:32.880 --> 07:37.270
<b><i>I hadn't even thought about the 
culture festival.</i></b>

07:37.270 --> 07:38.770
<b>Brain!</b>

07:40.690 --> 07:41.920
<b>What's up, Mimimi?</b>

07:41.920 --> 07:44.730
<b>Are you gonna be on the 
culture festival committee?</b>

07:46.730 --> 07:50.320
<b><i>I get the feeling Hinami will 
make it one of my tasks...</i></b>

07:50.850 --> 07:51.920
<b>Mmm, I don't...</b>

07:51.920 --> 07:54.030
<b>What?! Is that a "no"?</b>

07:54.400 --> 07:58.080
<b>But I'm expecting <i>such big 
things</i> from you, Brain!</b>

07:58.080 --> 08:01.500
<b>Yeah, but I can't actually 
<i>do</i> anything, though.</b>

08:02.740 --> 08:05.000
<b>There's that modesty again!</b>

08:05.610 --> 08:09.500
<b>Knowing you, I'm positive 
you'll do something nifty!</b>

08:11.340 --> 08:15.010
<b>I've never looked forward to 
a culture festival before...</b>

08:15.010 --> 08:16.470
<b>No way! Seriously?</b>

08:17.140 --> 08:20.640
<b>But... this year I do. A little.</b>

08:20.640 --> 08:22.810
<b>There you go! There you go!</b>

08:22.810 --> 08:27.650
<b>You gotta overwrite all those old unfun 
memories with this year's festival!</b>

08:27.990 --> 08:30.880
<b>Yeah... I guess so.</b>

08:30.880 --> 08:31.980
<b>Tomozaki!</b>

08:33.180 --> 08:36.620
<b>Let's make this year's culture 
festival <i>super-ultra-fun</i>!</b>

08:38.500 --> 08:39.490
<b>You got it!</b>

08:42.000 --> 08:44.000
<b>Bottom-Tier Character Tomozaki S2</b>

08:44.000 --> 08:46.210
<b>Sewing Room 2</b>

08:45.740 --> 08:47.460
<b>All right, let me ask you...</b>

08:49.190 --> 08:49.960
<b>Ask me what?</b>

08:50.200 --> 08:51.460
<b>First, there's Yuzu.</b>

08:51.990 --> 08:54.490
<b>Then Mimimi and Hanabi,</b>

08:54.490 --> 08:56.220
<b>and finally Fuka.</b>

08:56.480 --> 08:59.280
<b>Who would you most want to date?</b>

08:59.280 --> 09:00.090
<b>Huh?!</b>

09:01.150 --> 09:02.790
<b>Or...</b>

09:03.310 --> 09:05.060
<b>maybe you'd like to date me?</b>

09:07.780 --> 09:10.460
<b>Tell me. Who do you like?</b>

09:10.980 --> 09:12.780
<b>W-Well, uh...</b>

09:15.200 --> 09:17.490
<b>What's wrong? You're all red.</b>

09:19.160 --> 09:20.740
<b><i>Damn her...</i></b>

09:21.970 --> 09:27.750
<b>Now hang on. Why's Izumi even 
an option? That's not right!</b>

09:28.000 --> 09:32.100
<b>Ah, I see. You may have 
gained a level or three,</b>

09:32.100 --> 09:34.260
<b>but you're eternally chaste at heart.</b>

09:34.600 --> 09:36.130
<b>Mind your own business.</b>

09:36.620 --> 09:42.180
<b>Listen, there's no rule saying you 
can't go after a girl who's attached.</b>

09:42.180 --> 09:44.730
<b>It's not like she's married.</b>

09:45.260 --> 09:47.230
<b>That <i>is</i> true...</b>

09:47.520 --> 09:53.770
<b>What if Yuzu broke up with Nakamura 
and said she wanted to date you?</b>

09:53.770 --> 09:56.340
<b>What?! But that would never happen!</b>

09:56.340 --> 09:58.310
<b>No, it wouldn't.</b>

09:58.310 --> 09:59.240
<b>Hey!</b>

09:59.240 --> 10:02.490
<b>But what if it did? What would you do?</b>

10:02.740 --> 10:05.750
<b>I mean, jeez, I don't...</b>

10:06.160 --> 10:09.250
<b>That goes for other girls, 
too—not just Yuzu.</b>

10:09.790 --> 10:14.840
<b>If Mimimi or Hanabi or Fuka confessed 
their love to you, what would you do?</b>

10:14.840 --> 10:17.840
<b>Have you ever given it even 
the slightest thought?</b>

10:18.310 --> 10:21.200
<b>No, I mean, it wouldn't happen.</b>

10:21.200 --> 10:23.220
<b>That's true...</b>

10:23.630 --> 10:28.230
<b>But your inability to say one way or 
another ties into your current situation.</b>

10:29.840 --> 10:31.970
<b>Another what-if...</b>

10:31.970 --> 10:32.860
<b>Let's say...</b>

10:34.400 --> 10:37.940
<b>After school, a girl says she 
has something to talk about</b>

10:37.940 --> 10:40.280
<b>and gets you somewhere alone.</b>

10:40.950 --> 10:45.950
<b>She's a little embarrassed, but reveals 
that she's liked you for a while now.</b>

10:57.220 --> 10:59.470
<b>Well? Are you picturing it?</b>

10:59.890 --> 11:00.760
<b>Huh?!</b>

11:00.990 --> 11:05.310
<b>Wasn't there someone you could 
imagine dating? Just a little?</b>

11:05.310 --> 11:08.810
<b>No—well... maybe...</b>

11:09.510 --> 11:13.460
<b>Dating <i>her</i> will be the main 
focus of our work going forward.</b>

11:14.100 --> 11:17.610
<b>Oh, and ideally, there'd be two 
or more of them at any time.</b>

11:17.840 --> 11:22.250
<b>Two or more?! Why on earth? That's messed up!</b>

11:22.250 --> 11:24.910
<b>Some wiggle room is crucial.</b>

11:25.310 --> 11:29.410
<b>But two or more at the same time... 
There has to be another way.</b>

11:29.840 --> 11:35.320
<b>Just being able to think "I have other 
girlfriends" gives you a broader perspective</b>

11:35.320 --> 11:37.920
<b>and wiggle room for 
whatever you decide to do.</b>

11:37.920 --> 11:40.670
<b>That way you can keep a cool 
head for decision-making.</b>

11:41.260 --> 11:45.170
<b>This isn't just defense. It's offense, too.</b>

11:45.600 --> 11:46.510
<b>In other words,</b>

11:46.790 --> 11:52.520
<b>you throw one girl into a tizzy 
by hinting at others waiting in the wings.</b>

11:52.840 --> 11:55.020
<b>This is all really dark...</b>

11:55.480 --> 11:57.950
<b>If you think <i>that's</i> dark, 
you're only proving that</b>

11:57.950 --> 12:00.920
<b>you're still in the 
starry-eyed romantic stage.</b>

12:00.920 --> 12:03.770
<b>Y-You mean it gets <i>darker</i>?</b>

12:03.770 --> 12:06.660
<b>And don't forget the result of all this:</b>

12:06.660 --> 12:11.160
<b>You'll gain confidence in yourself for 
having done something that seemed so difficult.</b>

12:12.570 --> 12:14.670
<b>I get it...</b>

12:15.200 --> 12:16.670
<b>And with that...</b>

12:17.120 --> 12:18.170
<b>Which two girls?</b>

12:18.170 --> 12:20.420
<b>Small Goal: Who do you want to get closer to?</b>

12:18.620 --> 12:20.420
<b>Who do you want to get closer to?</b>

12:24.230 --> 12:26.930
<b>Can my answer wait a while?</b>

12:29.520 --> 12:30.980
<b>If you insist.</b>

12:31.430 --> 12:33.440
<b>But time is of the essence, so...</b>

12:33.770 --> 12:37.190
<b>Here—I'll give you an 
easy little task, too.</b>

12:37.810 --> 12:39.570
<b>Pinstagram?</b>

12:41.870 --> 12:46.560
<b>A woman who can do anything 
<i>would</i> take good pictures.</b>

12:44.700 --> 12:49.080
<b>402 posts / 6085 followers / 94 following
Aoi Hinami</b>

12:46.560 --> 12:49.080
<b>Look at you, getting the most out of life.</b>

12:49.520 --> 12:50.040
<b>Wait—</b>

12:50.420 --> 12:52.660
<b>you have <i>six thousand</i> followers?!</b>

12:53.000 --> 12:54.350
<b>That's insane...</b>

12:54.350 --> 12:55.330
<b>Not really.</b>

12:56.080 --> 12:57.730
<b>There's demand for it.</b>

12:57.730 --> 13:03.910
<b>It's just what happens if you 
keep posting high-quality photos.</b>

13:03.910 --> 13:06.750
<b>I honestly didn't plan for it.</b>

13:06.750 --> 13:07.840
<b>Huh...</b>

13:07.840 --> 13:09.780
<b>We got off-track.</b>

13:09.780 --> 13:13.600
<b>Anyway, I want you on Pinstagram.</b>

13:14.040 --> 13:16.350
<b>Me on Pinsta, eh?</b>

13:16.570 --> 13:21.360
<b>Yes. In order for you to live 
a normie life here at school,</b>

13:21.360 --> 13:24.380
<b>you need to boost your image among our class.</b>

13:24.910 --> 13:28.620
<b>The smallest things will 
shake up the hierarchy.</b>

13:28.960 --> 13:33.120
<b>It changes based on how others see you.</b>

13:33.470 --> 13:36.120
<b>Yeah, I get that.</b>

13:36.840 --> 13:39.080
<b>So your mini-task will be</b>

13:39.080 --> 13:44.340
<b>Mini-Task: Create private Pinstagram and self-promote</b>

13:39.660 --> 13:44.340
<b>to create a private Pinstagram 
account and do some self-promotion.</b>

13:44.990 --> 13:49.590
<b>Simple enough. I'll send 
you the details later.</b>

13:50.520 --> 13:51.340
<b>Okay.</b>

13:54.350 --> 13:56.850
<b>Here are those details. Simple, right? 
Pinsta Tasks: Selfie w/ Shuji & Takei</b>

13:57.120 --> 13:59.350
<b>She calls this <i>simple</i>?</b>

13:59.350 --> 14:05.360
<b>Pinsta Tasks: Selfie w/ Shuji & Takei, Takahiro in glasses, 
Hanabi making a face, Minami eating ramen, Selfie w/ Fuka</b>

14:00.400 --> 14:04.760
<b>This is going to be incredibly hard.</b>

14:07.750 --> 14:10.630
<b>I'm glad everything's calmed down.</b>

14:10.630 --> 14:11.330
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

14:12.040 --> 14:14.330
<b>Wasn't Hanabi amazing, though?</b>

14:14.330 --> 14:18.320
<b>It's as if she soared over 
all those walls in her way.</b>

14:18.320 --> 14:22.640
<b>I'm sure Hanabi always 
had the <i>strength</i> to fly.</b>

14:22.640 --> 14:25.690
<b>She just didn't know how to use her wings.</b>

14:26.120 --> 14:27.010
<b>Right.</b>

14:27.520 --> 14:31.020
<b>And once you can fly, you have total freedom.</b>

14:31.020 --> 14:32.510
<b>That's true.</b>

14:32.840 --> 14:37.380
<b>Kikuchi, I need to thank you 
again for all you've done.</b>

14:37.840 --> 14:39.290
<b>You were a huge help.</b>

14:39.290 --> 14:40.940
<b>S-Sure.</b>

14:40.940 --> 14:43.230
<b>I'd be happy to help again if you need me.</b>

14:43.710 --> 14:46.430
<b>Not that I can do very much.</b>

14:46.930 --> 14:48.650
<b>Sure you can!</b>

14:48.900 --> 14:52.030
<b>I might be leaning on you again someday.</b>

14:52.560 --> 14:53.960
<b>Whatever you need.</b>

14:54.800 --> 14:58.720
<b>G-Great. I'll let you know.</b>

14:58.720 --> 14:59.660
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

15:00.780 --> 15:01.670
<b>Still...</b>

15:02.030 --> 15:05.890
<b>I don't know what Hinami was thinking.</b>

15:05.890 --> 15:08.660
<b>Something felt a little... off.</b>

15:08.660 --> 15:10.680
<b>"Off," huh?</b>

15:10.910 --> 15:13.140
<b><i>So Kikuchi picked up on that, too.</i></b>

15:13.570 --> 15:18.300
<b>I'm wondering why Hinami 
thought to go to such lengths.</b>

15:18.300 --> 15:19.980
<b>It really has me curious...</b>

15:20.550 --> 15:25.670
<b>There must be something inside Hinami 
that just couldn't forgive her.</b>

15:26.700 --> 15:29.720
<b>There are some things even I can't forgive.</b>

15:31.360 --> 15:33.280
<b>When someone's angry,</b>

15:33.280 --> 15:36.600
<b>I think it's because the way 
things are doesn't match</b>

15:36.600 --> 15:39.540
<b>the way they think things ought to be.</b>

15:39.830 --> 15:43.880
<b>How things ought to be, huh?</b>

15:45.160 --> 15:48.200
<b><i>I wonder what that is for Hinami?</i></b>

15:50.510 --> 15:51.580
<b>Oh, right!</b>

15:53.020 --> 15:56.060
<b>There's something I'd like you 
to see, if you don't mind.</b>

15:59.310 --> 16:03.060
<b>I wrote a new novel, so, 
um... if you could...</b>

16:03.340 --> 16:05.560
<b>Y-Yeah, sure. Of course.</b>

16:07.150 --> 16:10.380
